      "Read the scores: \"Work not done %\" is completed ÷ assigned × 100 − 100 (100 assigned, 75 completed reads −25.0%). \"Work not done on time %\" is completed on time ÷ completed × 100 − 100 (50 completed, 40 on time reads −20.0%). 0 is perfect; more negative is worse. Nothing assigned shows \"No data\"; work assigned but nothing completed reads −100. They are the same numbers Task Control and Reports › Employee Task Performance show for the same person and dates.",
