      "Import many tasks at once: use \"Bulk Import\" in Tasks (only for roles that can assign work). To make a row First half or Second half work, write it in TASK FREQUENCY, for example \"Daily - First Half\" or \"Second Half\": First Half rows are always due 3:00 PM and Second Half rows 9:00 PM, whatever DUE TIME says. \"First & Second Half\" makes one task with two checkpoints, due 9:00 PM.",
