      "Reassign tasks to someone else (administrators): in Task Control open the Tasks tab. Tick rows and press \"Reassign selected\", or press \"Reassign all open work\" to move everything one person still has to do (every date, not only the filter dates). Choose \"Move work from\" (former employees are listed too), tick what to move (\"Open tasks due today or later\", \"Overdue tasks\", \"Open FMS steps\", \"Recurring schedules\" so future tasks go to the new person), pick the person under \"Move work to\", type a reason and press \"Reassign\". Completed work stays where it is. Anything that cannot move is listed with the reason, and the new person gets one notification. From Users, open the employee and press \"Reassign tasks\" to land straight in this screen.",
