      "Simulate routing: in Live Preview open Routing simulation to inspect selected routes and skipped sections. Use Next and Back to test the active path, Test validation to check required answers without saving, and Reset simulation to test another path. Inactive answers do not enter the final submission or customer synchronization.",
      "Configure conditional paths: edit a question and expand Conditions & Routing. Visibility Conditions selects Always show, Show only when conditions match, or Hide when conditions match. Add condition, Add AND group and Add OR group build nested comparisons with saved answer values. Ordered IF routes run first match first, with Set OTHERWISE as fallback. Go to question performs a forward jump; section eligibility still applies. Manage sections has Section Visibility and After this section. Explicit question routes take priority over the section end action. End current form stage submits through the existing FMS stage transaction; it does not finish the whole workflow.",
      "Fill a form: open Forms Library, find the form under \"Forms to fill\" (or use \"Search forms\"), and press \"Fill form\". On a phone the form opens full screen. Questions marked * must be answered, and the bar at the top counts them. Long forms are filled one step at a time with \"Next\" and \"Back\"; tap an earlier step to change it, and open \"Check your answers before submitting\" on the last step before pressing \"Submit form\". After a successful save, the form closes and a brief confirmation notice confirms submission. You return to the same Forms Library view, task subsection or FMS workflow board you opened it from. A missing answer is marked in red under the question. Some choice questions end with \"Other\": pick it and type your own answer in the box that appears.",
