      "CRM forms: form authors with CRM access see a \"CRM forms\" button under \"Forms to fill\". It lists the forms CRM uses to register queue clients and leads; edit and publish them like any form, and CRM uses each new published version. \"Fill form\" on a CRM form opens CRM registration, so the client or lead is really registered. Which form CRM uses is chosen in CRM → CLIENT QUEUE → CRM FORM SETTINGS.",
